// design.md "when statement": a condition waits on a hook in a pending branch of a
// package it imports, and is reported once that branch can no longer be selected,
// whichever package is reported first. `c` comes before `b`, and the `when` holding
// an import makes the program select its packages together.
package main;
import "./c";
import "./b";
when (true) { import "core:fmt"; }
main :: proc() {}
